cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these proofs, certificates or programs, please cite them as below, together with Sadhu-Ursin and Costa-Sadhu (see README.md)."
type: dataset
title: "Union-closed families: c_UC >= c* + 3.0e-4, a barrier for the method, and unions of translates"
abstract: "A computer-assisted proof that every finite union-closed family with a nonempty member has an element in more than a proportion c* + 3/10000 = 0.38318525996679779... of its members, with two separately written certifying programs and red controls; a product-measure barrier for the method at c* + 1.205e-3; and a reciprocity for unions of translates in finite groups. Internally refereed; not yet peer reviewed."
authors:
  - family-names: Canli
    given-names: Arhan
    affiliation: Quantavane
    email: arhan@quantavane.com
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://quantavane.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/arhancanli/quantavane-union-closed"
keywords:
  - union-closed sets conjecture
  - Frankl's conjecture
  - entropy method
  - interval arithmetic
